              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nya 29:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yoashi akawaambia makuhani, Fedha yote ya vitu vitakatifu iliyoletwa nyumbani mwa BWANA, fedha ya matumizi, fedha ya watu kadiri alivyoandikiwa kila mtu, na fedha yote iliyoletwa kama mtu yeyote aonavyo moyoni mwake kuileta nyumbani mwa BWANA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "makuhani na waitwae, kila mtu kwa hao awajuao; nao watatengeneza palipobomoka nyumbani, kila mahali palipoonekana pamebomoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.24.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nya 24:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini ikawa, mwaka wa ishirini na tatu wa mfalme Yoashi, makuhani walikuwa hawajatengeneza mabomoko ya nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo mfalme Yoashi akamwita Yehoyada kuhani, na makuhani wengine, akawauliza, Mbona hamtengenezi mabomoko ya nyumba? Basi sasa msipokee tena fedha kwa hao mwajuao, lakini itoeni kwa ajili ya mabomoko ya nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao makuhani wakakubali kwamba wasipokee fedha kwa watu, wala wasitengeneze mabomoko ya nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.21.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 21:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini Yehoyada kuhani akatwaa kasha, akatoboa tundu katika kifuniko chake, akaliweka karibu na madhabahu, upande wa kulia mtu aingiapo nyumbani mwa BWANA; na makuhani, waliolinda mlangoni, wakatia ndani yake fedha yote iliyoletwa nyumbani mwa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa, walipoona ya kuwa fedha nyingi imo kashani, karani wa mfalme akapanda na kuhani mkuu, wakaifunga mifukoni, wakaihesabu fedha iliyoonekana nyumbani mwa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na fedha iliyopimwa wakawapa mikononi wale waliofanya kazi, walioisimamia nyumba ya BWANA; na hao wakawatolea maseremala na wajenzi walioifanya kazi katika nyumba ya BWANA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na hao waashi, na wakata mawe, tena kununua miti na mawe ya kuchongwa, ili kuyatengeneza mabomoko ya nyumba ya BWANA, tena kwa gharama zote za kuitengeneza nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini havikufanywa kwa nyumba ya BWANA vikombe vya fedha, wala makasi, wala mabakuli, wala panda, wala vyombo vyovyote vya dhahabu, wala vyombo vya fedha, kwa hiyo fedha iliyoletwa nyumbani mwa BWANA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa sababu hiyo fedha waliwapa watenda kazi, wakaitengeneza kwayo nyumba ya BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:15"
